    "known_deviations": [
      "preprocessing: M3 uses the \u00a72 team default n_fft=1024 and 50-2000 Hz, identical to M2. M1 used n_fft=512 (self-declared deviation); M4 used n_fft=512 with a 20-8000 Hz full band to preserve AudioSet pretraining. Classification metrics remain comparable; spectrograms are not bit-identical across all rows.",
